{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"cmd":"import","ctl":"github","desc":"Install one or more drop-in Newbound libraries from a git URL: clones into repositories/<reponame> (URL basename), registers the repo in the dev.git registry (role library, autocommit on), then for EVERY data/<lib> in the repo symlinks data/<lib> (and runtime/<lib> when the repo carries one - it is optional), loads, and activates via dev.dev.activate_lib. Multi-library repos install every library or nothing: all collision checks run before anything moves. FFI libraries get their tracked crate dir linked and need the reported one restart. The repo must carry data/<lib> at its root.","import":"use ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::system_call::system_call;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse std::path::Path;\nuse std::os::unix::fs::symlink;\nuse crate::dev::dev::activate_lib::activate_lib;\nuse flowlang::appserver::load_library;\n","lib":"dev","params":[{"name":"url","type":"String"}],"returntype":"String","type":"rust"},"id":"nnjgwh189dcdca95fq7c","readers":[],"time":1787329444669,"username":"system","writers":[]}